      "text": "クロマメノキ は、ツツジ科スノキ属の落葉低木。"
    },
    "en": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (en): Vaccinium uliginosum",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vaccinium_uliginosum",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 1371692705,
      "text": "Vaccinium uliginosum is a Eurasian and North American flowering plant in the heath family. The berries are edible."
    },
    "es": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (es): Vaccinium uliginosum",
      "source_url": "https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vaccinium_uliginosum",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 174006207,
      "text": "Vaccinium uliginosum es una especie de planta fanerógama perteneciente a la familia de las ericáceas. En italiano es llamada \"mirtillo blu\", en francés \"airelle des marais\", \"myrtille des marais\" o \"myrtille bleue\", en alemán \"Rauschbeere\" o \"Moorbeere\", en neerlandés \"rijsbes\"."
    },
    "fr": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (fr): Airelle des marais",
      "source_url": "https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Airelle_des_marais",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 239691909,
      "text": "La myrtille des marais ou airelle des marais est une espèce de plante à fleurs de la famille des Ericaceae. C'est un sous-arbrisseau large de 30 à 80 cm que l'on le trouve dans les tourbières, les landes, les pentes rocheuses subalpines et les bois humides des montagnes circumboréales, entre 500 et 3 000 m d'altitude."
    },
    "pt": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (pt): Vaccinium uliginosum",
      "source_url": "https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vaccinium_uliginosum",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 64612331,
      "text": "Vaccinium uliginosum é uma espécie de planta com flor pertencente à família Ericaceae."
    }
